(
    title: "Pole Position",
    description: Some("A behind-the-car race in two parts. First you run a qualifying lap against a 90-second clock, needing 73 seconds or better to earn a grid place, and the quicker the lap the further forward you start. Then comes a four-lap Grand Prix where you shift between low and high gear, pass slower cars for points, and must beat the timer each lap to keep racing."),
